   "text": "Ulster University - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nUlster University\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nUlster University’s London and Birmingham branch campuses are delivered as a partnership between the University and QA Higher Education.\nThe branch campuses offer undergraduate and postgraduate degrees in business and computing subjects in professional learning environments. Our focus is to ensure graduates don’t just have a degree, but are highly employable and motivated individuals ready to function in a dynamic business environment.\nThe programmes at the branch campuses are validated by Ulster University and are taught by QA Higher Education.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n01/07/2026 05:35\nby Gunia Beniwal\nCreated\n27/03/2026 06:18\nby Gunia Beniwal\nType\nUniversity\nCountry\nUnited Kingdom\nYearly Fees\nMax: £18,000.00\nMin: £5,000.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n17%\n5,000 of 30,000 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPublic\nProvider\nQA Higher Education (QAHE)\nFounded Year\n1982\nCampus(es)\nLondon, Birmingham,  Coleraine, Manchester\nCountry\nUnited Kingdom\nExcluded Countries\nAfghanistan, Cameroon, Sudan\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n23/10/2023\nContract End Date\n20/10/2026\nContract Entity\nQSSA Ltd\nContract Status\nExpiring in 90 days\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nhttps://qa.ulster.ac.uk/campuses/accommodation/\nScholarship Offered\n-\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5oyySkFa_B8\nInternship Details\n-\nAdditional Information\nNotice: For Nigerian applicants, applications to all MSc International Business programmes and Extended International Business majors are not available for the September 2026 intake. For further information or confirmation, please contact your Account Manager.",
